---
// Pinterest Git Clone Optimization & Commit-Graph Diagram
---

<figure class="pt-diagram" aria-labelledby="pt-caption">
  <svg
    class="pt-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="pt-title pt-desc"
  >
    <title id="pt-title">
      Pinterest Git Clone 99% 耗時優化與 Commit-Graph 機制
    </title>
    <desc id="pt-desc">
      展示從龐大 Monorepo 物件拓撲遍歷瓶頸、Commit-Graph 二進位生成序號加速、Git
      物件過濾策略到 CI/CD 耗時從 40 分鐘降至 30 秒的全景對比。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="pt-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="pt-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Monorepo Bottleneck -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(20, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">THE BOTTLENECK</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">大型 Monorepo 瓶頸</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >海量歷史物件規模</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 500,000+ Commits 歷史</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 數萬 Branches 與 Tags</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• 數百 GB 儲存庫容量</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >協商階段 CPU 100%</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 物件協商 (Negotiation)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 解包遍歷 Commit 物件</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 單次 Clone 耗時 40+ 分鐘</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >CI/CD 產能癱瘓</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 數千 Runner 互相搶佔頻寬</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 開發者等待 PR 構建崩潰</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Commit-Graph Internals -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(255, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">CORE MECHANISM</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Commit-Graph 核心原理</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Generation Numbers</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 為 Commit 計算拓撲深度</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 可達性查詢 (Reachability)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• O(N) 遍歷降至 O(log N)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >二進位結構表 (.git/objects)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• OID Fanout 快速索引</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• OID Lookups 平行二分查</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 零解壓縮直接讀取 Parent</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >單行神奇指令</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• fetch.writeCommitGraph=true</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 每次 fetch 自動增量更新</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Advanced Clone Strategy -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(490, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">CLONE STRATEGY</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">現代進階 Clone 矩陣</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >Blobless Clone (推薦)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --filter=blob:none</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 僅拉取 Commit 與 Tree 拓撲</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 按需下載檔案 (支援 git log)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >Treeless Clone (CI 特化)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --filter=tree:0</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 連歷史目錄樹都不下載</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 極小傳輸量，最適合一次性 CI</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >Shallow Clone (淺層)</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• --depth=1</text>
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 僅取最新一個 Commit 狀態</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 4: Production Results -->
    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(725, 35)">
      <rect width="215" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">PRODUCTION IMPACT</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">生產實踐效益對比</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--teal" x="10" y="20"
          >耗時從 40m ➔ 30s</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Clone / Fetch 速度提升 80x</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 節省 99% 的拉取等待時間</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76">• CI 構建整體提速 65%</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 180)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="90"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--gold" x="10" y="20"
          >伺服器資源解放</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Git 伺服器 CPU 負載驟降 85%</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 網路出站頻寬大幅削減</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 消除 Runner 併發排隊</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 285)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="pt-diagram__subcard pt-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text class="pt-diagram__header pt-diagram__header--blue" x="10" y="20"
          >開發者體驗升級</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 本機切換分支毫秒級相應</text
        >
        <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• PR 自動化回饋極速到達</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connectors / Flow Lines -->
    <path
      d="M 235 155 L 255 155"
      class="pt-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 470 155 L 490 155"
      class="pt-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 705 155 L 725 155"
      class="pt-diagram__line"
      marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <svg
    class="pt-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 320 620"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="pt-m-title"
  >
    <title id="pt-m-title">Pinterest Git 優化（手機檢視）</title>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 10)">
      <rect width="300" height="130" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22">1. 巨型 Monorepo 瓶頸</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• 500,000+ Commits 與數百 GB 體積</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Git 協商階段 CPU 100% 深度遍歷</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• CI Runner 每次 Clone 耗時 40+ 分鐘</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 開發者 PR 驗證隊列嚴重塞車</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 155)">
      <rect width="300" height="135" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >2. Commit-Graph 底層加速</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Generation Number 拓撲深度序號</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• 可達性計算從 O(N) 驟降至 O(log N)</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• 二進位結構表直讀，免解壓 Commit 物件</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 單行配置：fetch.writeCommitGraph=true</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 305)">
      <rect width="300" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22">3. 現代進階 Clone 策略</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Blobless (--filter=blob:none)：按需拉檔案</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Treeless (--filter=tree:0)：CI 專用極速</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85"
        >• Shallow (--depth=1)：僅拉最新層狀態</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 傳輸體積削減 90% 以上</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="pt-diagram__card" transform="translate(10, 460)">
      <rect width="300" height="145" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="pt-diagram__badge" x="12" y="22"
        >4. 效益：40 分鐘 ➔ 30 秒</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="45"
        >• Git Clone 耗時縮短 99%</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="65"
        >• Git 伺服器 CPU 負載驟降 85%</text
      >
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="85">• CI 整體構建提速 65%</text>
      <text class="pt-diagram__desc" x="12" y="105"
        >• 全球數千名工程師協同效率大幅躍升</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <figcaption id="pt-caption" class="pt-diagram__caption">
    圖 1：Pinterest Git Clone 耗時優化 — 從 Commit-Graph 拓撲加速、物件過濾到
    CI/CD 效能躍升 99%
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .pt-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pt-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 960px;
    font-family:
      -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue",
      Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .pt-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
  }

  .pt-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .pt-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Theme variables */
  .pt-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .pt-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .pt-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard {
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--teal {
    fill: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);
    stroke: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__subcard--gold {
    fill: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    stroke: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
  }

  .pt-diagram__header {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #0f766e;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--teal {
    fill: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .pt-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #b45309;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__header--gold {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .pt-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #475569;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__desc {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .pt-diagram__line {
    stroke: #94a3b8;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__line {
    stroke: #475569;
  }

  .pt-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .pt-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #475569;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pt-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }
    .pt-diagram__mobile {
      display: block;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
